stateDiagram-v2
 [*] --> LOCAL
 LOCAL --> QUEUED: policy permitted
 QUEUED --> UPLOADING
 UPLOADING --> REMOTE_WRITTEN
 REMOTE_WRITTEN --> VERIFIED: readback sha256
 VERIFIED --> COLD: optional local eviction
 UPLOADING --> RETRY_WAIT: timeout/rate-limit
 RETRY_WAIT --> QUEUED
 REMOTE_WRITTEN --> CORRUPT: hash/auth failure
 CORRUPT --> QUEUED: re-upload after review
 LOCAL --> LOCAL_PROTECTED: sensitive
